INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('jeronartest/wcibasketball/devvit-skill-setup', 'devvit-skill-setup', 'jeronartest', 'wcibasketball', 'community', 'devvit-skill-setup jeronartest wcibasketball community devvit-skill-setup prepares a code repository for devvit skills by ensuring devvit-docs skill is added and configuring rules for working with Devvit. It benefits developers by streamlining the setup process. Devvit Skill Setup 是一个基本的设置，用于使代码仓库准备好使用 Devvit 技能。它包括添加 devvit-docs Skill 和配置规则文件 Devvit Skill Setup は、コードリポジトリを Devvit スキルの使用に準備するための基本的な設定です Devvit Skill Setup은 코드 저장소를 Devvit 기능을 사용할 수 있도록 준비하는 기본 설정입니다 devvit-skill-setup configura tu repositorio de código para usar habilidades de Devvit. Asegúrate de que esté listo para su uso. devvit-skill-setup configure votre référentiel de code pour utiliser les compétences de Devvit. Assurez-vous qu''il est prêt à l''emploi. devvit-skill-setup konfiguriert Ihr Code-Repository für die Verwendung von Devvit-Fähigkeiten. Stellen Sie sicher, dass es für die Verwendung bereit ist. O Devvit Skill Setup é uma habilidade que configura um repositório de código para usar habilidades Devvit, garantindo a configuração correta do Redis. Devvit Skill Setup — это навык, который настраивает кодовый репозиторий для использования навыков Devvit, обеспечивая правильную настройку Redis. مهارة Devvit Skill Setup هي مهارة تكوين مستودع الشفرة لاستخدام مهارات Devvit، وتضمن الإعداد الصحيح للريديس. how to use devvit-skill-setup devvit-skill-setup setup guide devvit-skill-setup alternative devvit-skill-setup vs devvit-docs devvit-skill-setup install what is devvit-skill-setup devvit-skill-setup configuration devvit-skill-setup troubleshooting Devvit Skill Setup 代码仓库设置 devvit-docs Skill 规则文件配置 AI工具 代码仓库管理 Ensures devvit-docs skill is added to the repository Calls devvit-docs with ''how does redis work'' to verify configuration Checks for common instruction files like AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md Inserts rules for working with Devvit into the repository Presents errors to the user if configuration fails devvit-skill-setup is a skill that performs basic setup tasks to make a code repository ready for devvit skills, including adding devvit-docs and configuring rules');
