접근","첫 방문 감지"],"es":["diseñar rutas de incorporación","JavaScript y Firebase","detección de la primera visita","modals de bienvenida","experiencia de usuario","onboarding personalizado","Herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","Agentes de IA para la creación de software"],"fr":["concevoir des parcours d''intégration","JavaScript et Firebase","détection de la première visite","modals de bienvenue","expérience utilisateur","onboarding personnalisé","Outils d''IA pour les développeurs","Agents d''IA pour la création de logiciels"],"de":["Onboarding-Pfade entwerfen","JavaScript und Firebase","Erstdetektion","Willkommensmodals","Benutzererfahrung","benutzerdefiniertes Onboarding","AI-Tools für Entwickler","KI-Agents für die Softwareerstellung"],"pt":["designing onboarding paths","caminhos de integração","JavaScript","Firebase Auth","detecção de primeira visita","modais de boas-vindas","listas de verificação personalizadas","UI guiada"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","путь интеграции","JavaScript","Firebase Auth","обнаружение первого визита","модальные окна приветствия","индивидуальные списки проверки","интерфейс пользователя с помощью руководства"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","مسار التكامل","JavaScript","Firebase Auth","اكتشاف الزيارة الأولى","نافذة ترحيب","قائمة مراجعة مخصصة","واجهة المستخدم مع إرشادات"]}},"owner":"smkun","repo":"32Gamers","repoPath":"smkun/32Gamers","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.512Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"designing-onboarding-paths","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Designing Onboarding Paths\n\nThis skill covers first-run experiences, checklists, and guided UI for the 32Gamers cyberpunk portal. The codebase uses vanilla JavaScript with Firebase Auth for user state detection.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### First-Visit Detection\n\n```javascript\n// scripts/app.js - Add to PortalManager class\ncheckFirstVisit() {\n    const hasVisited = localStorage.getItem(''32gamers_visited'');\n    if (!hasVisited) {\n        this.showWelcomeModal();\n        localStorage.setItem(''32gamers_v","body":"# Designing Onboarding Paths\n\nThis skill covers first-run experiences, checklists, and guided UI for the 32Gamers cyberpunk portal. The codebase uses vanilla JavaScript with Firebase Auth for user state detection.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### First-Visit Detection\n\n```javascript\n// scripts/app.js - Add to PortalManager class\ncheckFirstVisit() {\n    const hasVisited = localStorage.getItem(''32gamers_visited'');\n    if (!hasVisited) {\n        this.showWelcomeModal();\n        localStorage.setItem(''32gamers_visited'', ''true'');\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Admin First-Login Detection\n\n```javascript\n// firebase-admin.html - After successful auth\nfirebase.auth.onAuthStateChanged((user) => {\n    if (user) {\n        const adminKey = `32gamers_admin_${user.uid}`;\n        if (!localStorage.getItem(adminKey)) {\n            showAdminOnboarding();\n            localStorage.setItem(adminKey, ''true'');\n        }\n    }\n});\n```\n\n## Key Concepts\n\n| Concept | Storage Key | Purpose |\n|---------|-------------|---------|\n| First visit | `32gamers_visited` | Show welcome modal |\n| Admin first login | `32gamers_admin_{uid}` | Show admin tutorial |\n| Onboarding progress | `32gamers_onboarding` | Track checklist steps |\n| Dismissed hints | `32gamers_hints` | Don''t repeat tooltips |\n\n## Existing Patterns\n\n### Loading State (Already Implemented)\n\n```html\n<!-- index.html lines 64-80 -->\n<div class=\"loading-placeholder\">\n    <div class=\"spinner-container\">\n        <div class=\"spinner\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"loading-text\">[INITIALIZING NEURAL LINK]</p>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Status Messages (Admin Panel)\n\n```javascript\n// firebase-admin.html - 5-second auto-dismiss\nfunction showStatus(message, type = ''info'') {\n    statusDiv.innerHTML = `<div class=\"status-message ${type}\">${message}</div>`;\n    setTimeout(() => statusDiv.innerHTML = '''', 5000);\n}\n```\n\n### Keyboard Shortcuts (Discoverable)\n\n| Shortcut | Action | Location |\n|----------|--------|----------|\n| `Ctrl+Alt+A` | Admin panel | index.html:24-29 |\n| `Ctrl+F` | Search apps | app.js:158-216 |\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Welcome Modal Structure\n\n```html\n<div class=\"onboarding-modal hidden\" id=\"welcomeModal\">\n    <div class=\"modal-content cyber-border\">\n        <h2 class=\"glitch-text\">WELCOME, OPERATOR</h2>\n        <div class=\"onboarding-steps\">\n            <div class=\"step active\" data-step=\"1\">Browse Apps</div>\n            <div class=\"step\" data-step=\"2\">Use Search</div>\n            <div class=\"step\" data-step=\"3\">Admin Access</div>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"cyber-btn\" onclick=\"dismissWelcome()\">BEGIN</button>\n    </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Empty State with Guidance\n\n```javascript\n// When no apps exist in Firebase\nif (apps.length === 0) {\n    container.innerHTML = `\n        <div class=\"empty-state\">\n            <p class=\"neon-text\">NO APPS DETECTED</p>\n            <p>Press <kbd>Ctrl+Alt+A</kbd> to access admin and add your first app.</p>\n        </div>\n    `;\n}\n```\n\n## See Also\n\n- [activation-onboarding](references/activation-onboarding.md) - First-run flows and welcome screens\n- [engagement-adoption](references/engagement-adoption.md) - Feature discovery and nudges\n- [in-app-guidance](references/in-app-guidance.md) - Tooltips and contextual help\n- [product-analytics](references/product-analytics.md) - Tracking onboarding completion\n- [roadmap-experiments](references/roadmap-experiments.md) - Feature rollouts\n- [feedback-insights](references/feedback-insights.md) - User signals and improvements\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- See the **vanilla-javascript** skill for DOM manipulation and event handling\n- See the **firebase** skill for auth state detection\n- See the **css** skill for modal animations and cyberpunk styling\n- See the **google-oauth** skill for admin authentication flows"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:10:28.019Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing intuitive user onboarding flow creation using vanilla JavaScript and Firebase Auth.","zh":"非常适合需要使用原生JavaScript和Firebase Auth创建直观用户入门流程的前端代理。","ja":"vanilla JavaScriptとFirebase Authを使用して直感的なユーザーオンボーディングフローを作成する必要があるフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"vanilla JavaScript와 Firebase Auth를 사용하여直관적인 사용자 온보딩 흐름을 생성해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan una creación de flujo de incorporación de usuarios intuitiva utilizando vanilla JavaScript y Firebase Auth.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''une création de flux d''intégration utilisateur intuitive en utilisant vanilla JavaScript et Firebase Auth.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine intuitive Benutzer-Onboarding-Fluss-Erstellung mit vanilla JavaScript und Firebase Auth benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de uma criação de fluxo de integração de usuário intuitiva usando vanilla JavaScript e Firebase Auth.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходима интуитивно понятная настройка потока интеграции пользователя с использованием vanilla JavaScript и Firebase Auth.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء تدفق دمج مستخدم直ي باستخدام vanilla JavaScript و Firebase Auth."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design seamless first-run experiences, implement checklists, and guide users through UI with vanilla JavaScript and Firebase Auth for user state detection, enhancing user engagement on the 32Gamers cyberpunk portal.","zh":"赋予代理设计无缝的首次运行体验、实现检查列表，并使用vanilla JavaScript和Firebase Auth进行用户状态检测，通过UI引导用户，从而提高32Gamers赛博朋克门户上的用户参与度。","ja":"エージェントがシームレスな初期実行体験を設計し、チェックリストを実装し、vanilla JavaScriptとFirebase Authを使用してユーザーの状態を検出するとともに、UIを介してユーザーを誘導することで、32Gamersサイバーパンクポータルのユーザー参与度を高めることができます。","ko":"에이전트가 무결점의 첫 실행 경험을 설계하고, 체크리스트를 구현하고, vanilla JavaScript와 Firebase Auth를 사용하여 사용자 상태를 감지함으로써 UI를 통해 사용자를 안내하여 32Gamers 사이버펑크 포털의 사용자 참여도를 향상시킵니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar experiencias de primera ejecución perfectas, implementar listas de verificación y guiar a los usuarios a través de la UI con vanilla JavaScript y Firebase Auth para la detección de estado de usuario, mejorando la participación del usuario en el portal ciberpunk de 32Gamers.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des expériences de première exécution parfaites, de mettre en œuvre des listes de contrôle et de guider les utilisateurs à travers l''UI avec vanilla JavaScript et Firebase Auth pour la détection de l''état de l''utilisateur, améliorant l''engagement de l''utilisateur sur le portail cyberpunk de 32Gamers.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, perfekte Erstlauf-Erfahrungen zu entwerfen, Prüflisten zu implementieren und Benutzer durch die Benutzeroberfläche mit vanilla JavaScript und Firebase Auth für die Benutzerzustand-Erkennung zu führen, wodurch die Benutzerbeteiligung auf dem 32Gamers-Cyberpunk-Portal verbessert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetarem experiências iniciais sem interrupções, implementarem listas de verificação e guiarem os usuários pela interface do usuário com vanilla JavaScript e Firebase Auth para detecção de estado de usuário, melhorando o engajamento do usuário no portal ciberpunk 32Gamers.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать бесперебойные первоначальные trải nghiệm, реализовывать контрольные списки и направлять пользователей через пользовательский интерфейс с использованием vanilla JavaScript и Firebase Auth для обнаружения состояния пользователя, повышая вовлеченность пользователей на киберпанковом портале 32Gamers.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تصميم تجارب أولية سلسة، وتنفيذ قوائم التحقق، وتوجيه المستخدمين من خلال واجهة المستخدم باستخدام vanilla JavaScript و Firebase Auth لاكتشاف حالة المستخدم، وتحسين مشاركة المستخدم في بوابة 32Gamers السايبربانك."},"useCases":{"en":["Creating interactive welcome modals for first-time users","Implementing guided tours for new features using Firebase Auth","Developing personalized onboarding checklists with vanilla JavaScript"],"zh":["为首次使用的用户创建交互式欢迎模态框","使用Firebase Auth实现新功能的引导游览","使用vanilla JavaScript开发个性化的入门检查列表"],"ja":["初めてのユーザー向けのインタラクティブなウェルカムモーダルを作成する","Firebase Authを使用して新機能のガイドツアーを実装する","vanilla JavaScriptを使用してパーソナライズされたオンボーディングチェックリストを開発する"],"ko":["처음 사용하는 사용자를 위한 인터랙티브 웰컴 모달을 생성하는 것","Firebase Auth를 사용하여 새로운 기능에 대한 가이드 투어를 구현하는 것","vanilla JavaScript를 사용하여 개인화된 온보딩 체크리스트를 개발하는 것"],"es":["Crear modales de bienvenida interactivos para usuarios por primera vez","Implementar visitas guiadas para nuevas funciones utilizando Firebase Auth","Desarrollar listas de verificación personalizadas de incorporación con vanilla JavaScript"],"fr":["Créer des modales de bienvenue interactifs pour les utilisateurs premiers","Mettre en œuvre des visites guidées pour les nouvelles fonctionnalités en utilisant Firebase Auth","Développer des listes de vérification personnalisées d''intégration avec vanilla JavaScript"],"de":["Interaktive Willkommensmodale für erste Benutzer erstellen","Mithilfe von Firebase Auth geführte Touren für neue Funktionen implementieren","Mit vanilla JavaScript personalisierte Onboarding-Prüflisten entwickeln"],"pt":["Criar modais de boas-vindas interativos para usuários pela primeira vez","Implementar tours guiados para recursos novos usando Firebase Auth","Desenvolver listas de verificação de integração personalizadas com vanilla JavaScript"],"ru":["Создание интерактивных модальных окон приветствия для пользователей впервые","Реализация проводимых туров для новых функций с использованием Firebase Auth","Разработка персонализированных контрольных списков интеграции с использованием vanilla JavaScript"],"ar":["إنشاء نماذج ترحيب تفاعلية للمستخدمين لأول مرة","تنفيذ جولات موجهة لميزات جديدة باستخدام Firebase Auth","تطوير قوائم تحقق دمج مخصصة باستخدام vanilla JavaScript"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Firebase Auth setup","Limited to vanilla JavaScript","Specific to the 32Gamers cyberpunk portal"],"zh":["需要Firebase Auth设置","仅限vanilla JavaScript","特定于32Gamers赛博朋克门户"],"ja":["Firebase Authの設定が必要","vanilla JavaScriptのみ","32Gamersサイバーパンクポータルに特有"],"ko":["Firebase Auth 설정이 필요함","vanilla JavaScript로 제한됨","32Gamers 사이버펑크 포털에 특정됨"],"es":["Requiere configuración de Firebase Auth","Limitado a vanilla JavaScript","Específico para el portal ciberpunk de 32Gamers"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de Firebase Auth","Limité à vanilla JavaScript","Spécifique au portail cyberpunk de 32Gamers"],"de":["Benötigt Firebase Auth-Setup","Begrenzt auf vanilla JavaScript","Spezifisch für das 32Gamers-Cyberpunk-Portal"],"pt":["Exige configuração do Firebase Auth","Limitado a vanilla JavaScript","Específico para o portal ciberpunk 32Gamers"],"ru":["Требует настройки Firebase Auth","Ограничен vanilla JavaScript","Конкретно для киберпанковского портала 32Gamers"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Firebase Auth","محدود بvanilla JavaScript","محدد لبوابة 32Gamers السايبربانك"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"ce967a2f5058afc0606cfde40968aa0269282d1814e9913df19f12a0c43d7e89","qualityScore":36}');
