oraciones de una película que captura la esencia de la historia","fr":"Un logline est une description d''une ou deux phrases d''un film qui capture l''essence de l''histoire","de":"Ein Logline ist eine Beschreibung von einem oder zwei Sätzen eines Films, die die Essenz der Geschichte erfassen","pt":"Logline é uma técnica de escrita que resume a história em uma ou duas frases, destacando seu gancho principal","ru":"Логлайн - это техника написания, которая суммирует историю в одно или два предложения, подчеркивая основной хук","ar":"لوغلاين هو تقنية كتابة تلخص القصة في جملة أو جملتين، وتبرز Hooks الرئيسية"},"features":{"en":["Applies WTFB methodology for effective hooks","Contains four essential components for a compelling logline","Supports upstream sync for multi-AI harness","Enables testing of concept clarity and marketing of screenplays"],"zh":["使用多个 AI 模型进行剧情简介生成","支持上游同步，实时更新您的项目","根据 WTFB 方法论，包含四个关键元素：剧情、人物、冲突、解决方案","用于创建电影、小说和剧本的引人入胜的剧情简介","支持多种格式，包括一两句话的描述"],"ja":["複数の AI モデルを使用してログラインを生成","アップストリーム同期をサポートし、プロジェクトをリアルタイムで更新","WTFB 方法論に基づき、4 つの重要な要素：ストーリー、キャラクター、コンフリクト、解決を含む","映画、小説、脚本のための魅力的ログラインを作成","複数のフォーマットをサポートし、一兩句话の説明を含む"],"ko":["여러 개의 AI 모델을 사용하여 로그라인을 생성","업스트림 동기화를 지원하여 프로젝트를 실시간으로 업데이트","WTFB 방법론에 기반하여 4개의 주요 요소: 스토리, 캐릭터, 갈등, 해결을 포함","스크린플레이 및 소설을 위한 매력적인 로그라인을 생성","여러 형식을 지원하며, 한두 문장의 설명을 포함"],"es":["Plantilla de proyecto creativo para guiones y novelas","Sincronización multi-AI para producción de películas","Desarrollo de materiales de presentación con invocation triggers","Pruebas de conceptos con cuatro componentes de hook","Aplicación de metodología WTFB para hooks efectivos"],"fr":["Modèle de projet créatif pour scénarios et romans","Synchronisation multi-AI pour production de films","Développement de matériel de présentation avec invocation triggers","Tests de concepts avec quatre composantes de hook","Application de la méthodologie WTFB pour des hooks efficaces"],"de":["Vorlage für kreative Projekte für Drehbücher und Romane","Multi-AI-Synchronisierung für Filmproduktion","Entwicklung von Präsentationsmaterial mit Invocation-Triggern","Konzepttests mit vier Komponenten von Hook","Anwendung der WTFB-Methode für effektive Hooks"],"pt":["Criação de hooks atraentes para projetos de tela","Desenvolvimento de materiais de pitch","Teste de conceitos para garantir clareza e atratividade","Aplicação da metodologia WTFB para hooks eficazes","Integração com multi-AI para sincronização upstream"],"ru":["Создание привлекательных хуков для проектов экрана","Разработка материалов для пича","Тестирование концепций для обеспечения ясности и привлекательности","Применение методологии WTFB для эффективных хуков","Интеграция с multi-ИИ для синхронизации upstream"],"ar":["إنشاء Hooks جذابة لمشاريع الشاشة","تطوير مواد للعرض التقديمي","اختبار المفاهيم لضمان الوضوح والجاذبية","تطبيق منهجية WTFB لإنشاء Hooks فعالة","التكامل مع متعدد الذكاء الاصطناعي للتنظيم المتقدم"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use logline","what is logline","logline alternative","logline vs screenplay summary","logline install","logline setup guide","creative project template","screenplay pitch materials","story hook generation"],"zh":["logline AI Éージェント","剧情简介生成","电影剧本","小说创作","WTFB 方法论","多个 AI 模型","上游同步","实时更新"],"ja":["logline AI エージェント","ログライン生成","映画脚本","小説作成","WTFB 方法論","複数の AI モデル","アップストリーム同期","リアルタイム更新"],"ko":["logline AI 에이전트","로그라인 생성","스크린플레이","소설 작성","WTFB 방법론","여러 개의 AI 모델","업스트림 동기화","실시간 업데이트"],"es":["logline","herramientas de ia para proyectos creativos","plantilla de proyecto para guiones","sincronización multi-ai","invocation triggers","metodología wtfg","desarrollo de materiales de presentación","pruebas de conceptos"],"fr":["logline","outils d''ia pour projets créatifs","modèle de projet pour scénarios","synchronisation multi-ai","invocation triggers","méthodologie wtfg","développement de matériel de présentation","tests de concepts"],"de":["logline","ki-tools für kreative projekte","vorlage für drehbücher","multi-ai-synchronisierung","invocation-triggers","wtfg-methode","entwicklung von präsentationsmaterial","konzepttests"],"pt":["logline","hooks para projetos de tela","metodologia WTFB","desenvolvimento de materiais de pitch","testes de conceitos","multi-AI","sincronização upstream","guias de configuração de logline"],"ru":["логлайн","хуки для проектов экрана","методология WTFB","разработка материалов для пича","тестирование концепций","multi-ИИ","синхронизация upstream","руководство по настройке логлайна"],"ar":["لوغلاين","Hooks لمشاريع الشاشة","منهجية WTFB","تطوير مواد للعرض التقديمي","اختبار المفاهيم","متعدد الذكاء الاصطناعي","تنظيم متقدم","دليل إعداد لوغلاين"]}},"owner":"bybren-llc","repo":"story-systems-template","repoPath":"bybren-llc/story-systems-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.564Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"logline","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Logline Skill\n\n## Invocation Triggers\nApply this skill when:\n- Distilling a story to its essential hook\n- Preparing pitch materials\n- Testing if a concept is clear and compelling\n- Marketing a screenplay\n\n## What is a Logline?\n\nA logline (also called a \"hook\") is a one to two sentence description of your movie that captures the essence of the story in a way that makes people want to see it.\n\n## The Four Components of a Hook\n\nPer WTFB methodology, every effective hook contains these four elemen","body":"# Logline Skill\n\n## Invocation Triggers\nApply this skill when:\n- Distilling a story to its essential hook\n- Preparing pitch materials\n- Testing if a concept is clear and compelling\n- Marketing a screenplay\n\n## What is a Logline?\n\nA logline (also called a \"hook\") is a one to two sentence description of your movie that captures the essence of the story in a way that makes people want to see it.\n\n## The Four Components of a Hook\n\nPer WTFB methodology, every effective hook contains these four elements:\n\n### 1. Characters\n- Who are they?\n- What do they want?\n- What are their goals?\n\n### 2. Conflict\n- What is the main obstacle to achieving their goal?\n- Who or what opposes them?\n\n### 3. Setting\n- Time period\n- Genre\n- Style/tone\n\n### 4. Action\n- What exciting things happen?\n- **Never be boring!**\n\n## Logline Formula\n\n```\n[ADJECTIVE] [PROTAGONIST TYPE] must [GOAL/ACTION]\nwhen [INCITING INCIDENT/CONFLICT],\nor else [STAKES].\n```\n\n### Alternative Formula\n```\nWhen [SETUP], a [PROTAGONIST] must [OBJECTIVE]\nbefore [ANTAGONIST] [THREAT].\n```\n\n### Genre-Specific Formula\n```\nA [GENRE] about [PROTAGONIST] who [SITUATION]\nuntil [CATALYST] forces them to [ACTION]\nagainst [ANTAGONIST/OBSTACLE].\n```\n\n## Classic Logline Examples\n\n### Raiders of the Lost Ark\n\"An archeologist is hired by the U.S. government to find the Ark of the Covenant before the Nazis.\"\n\n**Breakdown**:\n- Character: Archeologist (implies adventure, intelligence)\n- Conflict: Race against Nazis\n- Setting: Implied WWII era, adventure genre\n- Action: \"Find\" + competing with Nazis = excitement\n\n### Gladiator\n\"A Roman general is betrayed and his family killed by an insane emperor. Now a gladiator, he comes to Rome for revenge.\"\n\n**Breakdown**:\n- Character: Roman general (status, skill)\n- Conflict: Betrayal, loss, revenge against emperor\n- Setting: Roman era, epic drama\n- Action: Gladiator combat, revenge journey\n\n## Logline Development Worksheet\n\n### Step 1: Core Elements\n```\nPROTAGONIST: ___________________________________\n(Be specific: not \"a man\" but \"a disgraced surgeon\")\n\nGOAL: ___________________________________\n(What do they actively pursue?)\n\nANTAGONIST/OBSTACLE: ___________________________________\n(Person, force, or circumstance opposing them)\n\nSTAKES: ___________________________________\n(What happens if they fail?)\n\nUNIQUE ELEMENT: ___________________________________\n(What makes THIS story different?)\n```\n\n### Step 2: Draft Loglines\n\n**Draft 1** (Basic):\n```\n___________________________________________________\n___________________________________________________\n```\n\n**Draft 2** (Add specificity):\n```\n___________________________________________________\n___________________________________________________\n```\n\n**Draft 3** (Add stakes):\n```\n___________________________________________________\n___________________________________________________\n```\n\n**Final Logline**:\n```\n___________________________________________________\n___________________________________________________\n```\n\n## Logline Quality Checklist\n\n### Must Have\n- [ ] Protagonist clearly identified\n- [ ] Goal/objective stated\n- [ ] Conflict/obstacle present\n- [ ] Implies genre\n- [ ] One to two sentences maximum\n- [ ] Creates desire to know more\n\n### Should Have\n- [ ] Unique hook or twist\n- [ ] Stakes implied or stated\n- [ ] Active voice (character DOES something)\n- [ ] Specific rather than vague\n\n### Must Avoid\n- [ ] No questions (\"What if...?\")\n- [ ] No character names (unless famous)\n- [ ] No theme statements\n- [ ] No backstory\n- [ ] No \"and then\" chains\n\n## Common Logline Mistakes\n\n| Mistake | Example | Fix |\n|---------|---------|-----|\n| Too vague | \"A man faces challenges\" | \"A retired hitman hunts the men who killed his dog\" |\n| Too long | Multiple sentences | Cut to one powerful sentence |\n| No conflict | \"A woman discovers her past\" | \"A woman must confront the cult that raised her\" |\n| Passive | \"A story about love\" | \"A dying man races to reconnect with his estranged daughter\" |\n| Lists events | \"First X, then Y, then Z\" | Focus on central conflict |\n| Theme not story | \"An exploration of grief\" | \"A widow must solve her husband''s murder\" |\n\n## Genre-Specific Tips\n\n### Action/Thriller\n- Emphasize physical stakes and ticking clock\n- \"Must stop X before Y happens\"\n\n### Comedy\n- Hint at the comedic situation or irony\n- Include the fish-out-of-water element\n\n### Drama\n- Focus on internal conflict made external\n- Emphasize emotional stakes\n\n### Horror\n- Establish the threat\n- Imply isolation or helplessness\n\n### Romance\n- Show the obstacle to love\n- Include what makes this couple unique\n\n## Logline Testing\n\nShare your logline and ask:\n1. Do they understand the genre?\n2. Do they know who the protagonist is?\n3. Can they identify the conflict?\n4. Do they want to know what happens?\n5. Can they picture the movie?\n\nIf \"no\" to any, revise.\n\n## Validation Checklist\n\n- [ ] Logline is 25 words or fewer\n- [ ] Protagonist is specific and interesting\n- [ ] Goal is clear and active\n- [ ] Conflict/obstacle is compelling\n- [ ] Stakes are implied or stated\n- [ ] Genre is clear\n- [ ] Creates curiosity to see the film\n- [ ] No character names used\n- [ ] Active voice throughout\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:11:39.019Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Creative Writing Agents needing concise storytelling and pitch generation capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要简洁故事讲述和推介生成能力的创意写作代理","ja":"コンパクトなストーリーテリングとピッチ生成機能を必要とするクリエイティブライティングエージェントに最適","ko":"간결한 스토리 텔링과 피치 생성 능력이 필요한 크리에이티브 라이팅 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Escritura Creativa que necesitan capacidades de narración concisa y generación de piches.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Écriture Créative ayant besoin de capacités de narration concise et de génération de pitches.","de":"Perfekt für Kreative Schreibagenten, die eine präzise Erzählung und Pitch-Generierungsfähigkeiten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Escrita Criativa que necessitam de capacidades de contação de histórias concisas e geração de pitches.","ru":"Идеально для агентов творческого письма, требующих краткого рассказа и генерации питчей.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الكتابيين الإبداعيين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات سرد قصصية موجزة وإنشاء عروض تقديمية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to craft compelling one-sentence hooks using WTFB methodology, incorporating essential components of a logline, and testing concept clarity through logline analysis, leveraging natural language processing and machine learning protocols.","zh":"通过WTFB方法论，纳入剧情简介的基本组成部分，并通过剧情简介分析测试概念清晰度，利用自然语言处理和机器学习协议，赋予代理创造力，编写出吸引人的一句话钩子","ja":"WTFB方法論を使用して、ログラインの基本要素を組み込み、ログライン分析を介してコンセプトの明確性をテストし、自然言語処理と機械学習プロトコルを利用して、エージェントが魅力的の一文フックを作成できるようにする","ko":"WTFB 방법론을 사용하여 로그라인의 기본 구성 요소를 포함하고 로그라인 분석을 통해 개념의 명확성을 테스트하며, 자연어 처리와 기계 학습 프로토콜을 활용하여 에이전트가 매력적인 한 문장 후크를 만들 수 있도록 하는 강력한 기능","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear ganchos comprensivos de una oración utilizando la metodología WTFB, incorporando componentes esenciales de una logline, y probando la claridad del concepto a través del análisis de logline, aprovechando protocolos de procesamiento de lenguaje natural y aprendizaje automático.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des accroches complètes en une phrase en utilisant la méthodologie WTFB, en incorporant des composants essentiels d''une logline, et en testant la clarté du concept à travers l''analyse de logline, en exploitant les protocoles de traitement du langage naturel et les protocoles d''apprentissage automatique.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, überzeugende Ein-Satz-Hooks unter Verwendung der WTFB-Methode zu erstellen, die wesentliche Bestandteile einer Logline einbeziehen und die Konzeptklarheit durch Logline-Analyse testen, unter Nutzung von Protokollen für die natürliche Sprachverarbeitung und maschinelles Lernen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar ganchos atraentes de uma frase usando a metodologia WTFB, incorporando componentes essenciais de uma linha de log, e testando a clareza do conceito por meio da análise da linha de log, aproveitando protocolos de processamento de linguagem natural e aprendizado de máquina.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать привлекательные крючки из одного предложения, используя методологию WTFB, включающую необходимые компоненты логлайна, и проверяя ясность концепции посредством анализа логлайна, используя протоколы обработки естественного языка и машинного обучения.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء محابس جذابة من جملة واحدة باستخدام منهجية WTFB، ودمج المكونات الأساسية للخط اللوجي، واختبار وضوح المفاهيم من خلال تحليل الخط اللوجي، مستفيداً من بروتوكولات معالجة اللغة الطبيعية وبروتوكولات التعلم الآلي."},"useCases":{"en":["Distilling complex stories into concise loglines","Generating pitch materials for screenplays and novels","Testing concept clarity and compellingness"],"zh":["提炼复杂的故事成简洁的剧情简介","为剧本和小说生成推介材料","测试概念的清晰度和吸引力"],"ja":["複雑なストーリーをコンパクトなログラインに凝縮する","脚本と小説のピッチ資料を生成する","コンセプトの明確性と魅力度をテストする"],"ko":["복잡한 스토리를 간결한 로그라인으로 요약","스크립트와 소설의 피치 자료를 생성","개념의 명확성과 매력도를 테스트"],"es":["Destilar historias complejas en loglines concisas","Generar materiales de presentación para guiones y novelas","Probar la claridad y atractivo del concepto"],"fr":["Distiller des histoires complexes en loglines concises","Générer des matériaux de présentation pour les scénarios et les romans","Tester la clarté et l''attrait du concept"],"de":["Komplexe Geschichten in präzise Loglines destillieren","Präsentationsmaterialien für Drehbücher und Romane generieren","Konzeptklarheit und Überzeugungskraft testen"],"pt":["Destilar histórias complexas em linhas de log concisas","Gerar materiais de pitch para roteiros e romances","Testar a clareza e atração do conceito"],"ru":["Переливать сложные истории в краткие логлайны","Генерировать материалы для питчей для сценариев и романов","Тестировать ясность и привлекательность концепции"],"ar":["إخبار القصص المعقدة إلى خطوط سجل موجزة","إنشاء مواد عروض تقديمية لأفلام ومسرحيات وروايات","اختبار وضوح المفاهيم وجذابيتها"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of storytelling principles","Limited to English language support"],"zh":["需要了解故事讲述原理","仅限英语语言支持"],"ja":["ストーリーテリングの原則の理解が必要","英語のみのサポート"],"ko":["스토리 텔링 원리의 이해가 필요","영어만 지원"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de los principios de la narración","Limitado al soporte del idioma inglés"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des principes de narration","Limité au support de la langue anglaise"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis der Erzählprinzipien","Begrenzt auf Englisch-Sprachunterstützung"],"pt":["Exige compreensão dos princípios da narrativa","Limitado ao suporte da língua inglesa"],"ru":["Требует понимания принципов повествования","Ограничен поддержкой только английского языка"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم مبادئ السرد","محدود لدعم اللغة الإنجليزية فقط"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"f5f7c6ddd66ddb52c6183af56bf90a5a44f9919f353266c2e9a6030fb710a429","qualityScore":36}');
