es":"dev-workflow es un modelo de desarrollo que combina herramientas de AI y SDLC para mejorar la eficiencia","fr":"dev-workflow est un modèle de développement qui combine des outils d''IA et SDLC pour améliorer l''efficacité","de":"dev-workflow ist ein Entwicklungsmodell, das KI-Tools und SDLC kombiniert, um die Effizienz zu verbessern","pt":"O dev-workflow é um modelo de fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento que utiliza ferramentas AI-nativas para agilizar o desenvolvimento de software","ru":"Dev-workflow - это модель потока разработки, которая использует ИИ Агенты для ускорения разработки программного обеспечения","ar":"dev-workflow هو نموذج تدفق عمل التطوير الذي يستخدم أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي أصلية لتعزيز تطوير البرمجيات"},"features":{"en":["Utilizes MCP tools such as mcp__linear__get_issue for intake phase","Employs mcp__memory__search_nodes for exploration and planning","Supports code generation and editing with mcp__context7__query-docs","Integrates with Notion for notion-search and notion-create-pages","Facilitates GitHub integration for search_code, create_branch, and more","Streamlines testing and review with automated workflows"],"zh":["支持SDLC（软件开发生命周期）各阶段","集成MCP工具，包括mcp__linear__get_issue和mcp__notion__notion-search","提供代码、测试和部署功能","支持GitHub和Notion集成","实现快速开发和生产就绪"],"ja":["SDLC（ソフトウェア開発ライフサイクル）各段階をサポート","MCPツールを統合、mcp__linear__get_issueとmcp__notion__notion-searchを含む","コード、テスト、デプロイ機能を提供","GitHubとNotionの統合をサポート","迅速な開発と生産就緒を実現"],"ko":["SDLC(소프트웨어 개발 생명주기) 각 단계를 지원","MCP 도구를 통합하여 mcp__linear__get_issue와 mcp__notion__notion-search를 포함","코드, 테스트 및 배포 기능을 제공","GitHub 및 Notion 통합을 지원","빠른 개발 및 생산 준비를 구현"],"es":["Integración con MCP Tools para la gestión de issues y código","Uso de Notion para la creación de páginas y seguimiento de proyectos","Implementación de SDLC con fases de intake, triage, explore, plan, code, test, review, commit, deploy e improve","Compatibilidad con herramientas de desarrollo como GitHub y Context7","Capacidad de búsqueda y consulta de documentos con MCP Tools y Context7"],"fr":["Intégration avec MCP Tools pour la gestion des problèmes et du code","Utilisation de Notion pour la création de pages et le suivi de projets","Mise en œuvre de SDLC avec des phases d''intake, triage, exploration, planification, code, test, examen, validation, déploiement et amélioration","Compatibilité avec des outils de développement tels que GitHub et Context7","Capacité de recherche et de consultation de documents avec MCP Tools et Context7"],"de":["Integration mit MCP Tools für die Verwaltung von Issues und Code","Verwendung von Notion für die Erstellung von Seiten und Projektverfolgung","Implementierung von SDLC mit Phasen für Intake, Triage, Exploration, Planung, Code, Test, Überprüfung, Commit, Deployment und Verbesserung","Kompatibilität mit Entwicklungstools wie GitHub und Context7","Fähigkeit zur Suche und Abfrage von Dokumenten mit MCP Tools und Context7"],"pt":["Integração com ferramentas AI-nativas como mcp__linear__get_issue e mcp__notion__notion-search","Suporte a fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento ágil","Ferramentas de busca e criação de issues e branches","Integração com GitHub e Notion","Suporte a desenvolvimento de software em dias, não meses"],"ru":["Интеграция с ИИ Агентами như mcp__linear__get_issue и mcp__notion__notion-search","Поддержка гибкого потока разработки","Инструменты поиска и создания задач и веток","Интеграция с GitHub и Notion","Поддержка разработки программного обеспечения в течение дней, а не месяцев"],"ar":["التكامل مع أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي أصلية مثل mcp__linear__get_issue و mcp__notion__notion-search","دعم تدفق عمل التطوير المرن","أدوات البحث وإنشاء المشاكل والفروع","التكامل مع GitHub و Notion","دعم تطوير البرمجيات في أيام، لا أشهر"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use dev-workflow","dev-workflow setup guide","dev-workflow alternative","dev-workflow vs linear","what is dev-workflow","dev-workflow install","SDLC template with AI-native tools","mcp tools for development","AI-powered software development life cycle"],"zh":["dev-workflow","AI原生开发工作流","软件开发加速","SDLC","MCP工具","GitHub集成","Notion集成","代码开发","测试和部署"],"ja":["dev-workflow","AIエージェントによる開発ワークフロー","ソフトウェア開発加速","SDLC","MCPツール","GitHub統合","Notion統合","コード開発","テストとデプロイ"],"ko":["dev-workflow","AI 네이티브 개발 워크플로","소프트웨어 개발 가속","SDLC","MCP 도구","GitHub 통합","Notion 통합","코드 개발","테스트 및 배포"],"es":["desarrollo de aplicaciones con AI","herramientas de AI para desarrollo","MCP Tools","Notion","SDLC","GitHub","Context7","desarrollo de software con KI","flujo de trabajo de desarrollo"],"fr":["développement d''applications avec IA","outils d''IA pour le développement","MCP Tools","Notion","SDLC","GitHub","Context7","développement de logiciels avec IA","flux de travail de développement"],"de":["Anwendungsentwicklung mit KI","KI-Tools für die Entwicklung","MCP Tools","Notion","SDLC","GitHub","Context7","Softwareentwicklung mit KI","Entwicklungsworkflow"],"pt":["dev-workflow","fluxo de trabalho de desenvolvimento","ferramentas AI-nativas","desenvolvimento de software ágil","mcp__linear__get_issue","mcp__notion__notion-search","GitHub","Notion"],"ru":["dev-workflow","поток разработки","ИИ Агенты","гибкая разработка","mcp__linear__get_issue","mcp__notion__notion-search","GitHub","Notion"],"ar":["dev-workflow","تدفق عمل التطوير","أدوات ذكاء اصطناعي أصلية","تطوير البرمجيات المرن","mcp__linear__get_issue","mcp__notion__notion-search","GitHub","Notion"]}},"owner":"muyen","repo":"vibe-to-prod","repoPath":"muyen/vibe-to-prod","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.577Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"dev-workflow","description":"SDLC workflow with MCP tools. Triggers on start, implement, work on, or unclear workflow.","bodyPreview":"# SDLC: Intake → Triage → Explore → Plan → Code → Test → Review → Commit → Deploy → Improve\n\n## MCP Tools by Phase\n\n| Phase | Tools |\n|-------|-------|\n| Intake | `mcp__linear__get_issue`, `mcp__notion__notion-search` |\n| Explore | `mcp__memory__search_nodes`, `mcp__github__search_code`, `mcp__context7__query-docs` |\n| Plan | `mcp__linear__create_issue` (subtasks), `mcp__notion__notion-create-pages`, `mcp__github__create_branch` |\n| Code | `mcp__context7__query-docs`, Read, Write, Edit |\n| Test","body":"# SDLC: Intake → Triage → Explore → Plan → Code → Test → Review → Commit → Deploy → Improve\n\n## MCP Tools by Phase\n\n| Phase | Tools |\n|-------|-------|\n| Intake | `mcp__linear__get_issue`, `mcp__notion__notion-search` |\n| Explore | `mcp__memory__search_nodes`, `mcp__github__search_code`, `mcp__context7__query-docs` |\n| Plan | `mcp__linear__create_issue` (subtasks), `mcp__notion__notion-create-pages`, `mcp__github__create_branch` |\n| Code | `mcp__context7__query-docs`, Read, Write, Edit |\n| Test | Bash (make test, npm test), `/quick-test` |\n| Deploy | `mcp__github__create_pull_request`, `/smoke-test` |\n| Improve | `mcp__memory__create_entities`, `mcp__linear__create_issue` |\n\n## Triage Decision\n\n| Change Type | Path |\n|-------------|------|\n| New feature, breaking change, architecture | OpenSpec → `/openspec:proposal` |\n| Bug fix, config, tests, typo | Quick → `TodoWrite` |\n\n## Phase Actions\n\n**Intake**: Fetch Linear issue, search Notion for context\n**Explore**: Search Memory for learnings, explore codebase, check related PRs\n**Plan**: OpenSpec proposal OR TodoWrite, create branch\n**Code**: Follow tasks, use platform rules, mark todos complete\n**Test**: `/quick-test`, add tests for new logic\n**Review**: `/code-review`, `/security-scan` if auth/data\n**Commit**: `/commit` with `type: description`\n**Deploy**: Create PR, run smoke tests after merge\n**Improve**: Store learnings in Memory, create improvement tasks if needed\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n```bash\n# Backend\ncd backend && make test\ncd backend && make build\n\n# Web\ncd web && npm test\ncd web && npm run build\n\n# iOS\ncd mobile/ios && make test\n\n# Android\ncd mobile/android && ./gradlew test\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- Coding without exploring → miss patterns\n- Skipping Linear context → untracked work\n- No Memory capture → repeat learnings\n- Big commits → hard to review\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:11:49.096Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Full-Stack Development Agents seeking to automate the software development life cycle using AI-native tools like Notion and GitHub","zh":"适合寻求使用AI原生工具（如Notion和GitHub）自动化软件开发生命周期的全栈开发代理","ja":"AIネイティブツール（例：Notion、GitHub）を使用してソフトウェア開発ライフサイクルを自動化しようとするフルスタック開発エージェントに最適","ko":"Notion 및 GitHub과 같은 AI 네이티브 도구를 사용하여 소프트웨어 개발 수명주기를 자동화하려는 풀 스택 개발 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollo de Pilas Complejas que buscan automatizar el ciclo de vida del desarrollo de software utilizando herramientas nativas de IA como Notion y GitHub","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement full-stack qui cherchent à automatiser le cycle de vie du développement logiciel à l''aide d''outils natifs IA tels que Notion et GitHub","de":"Ideal für Full-Stack-Entwicklungsagenten, die den Software-Entwicklungslebenszyklus mithilfe von AI-nativen Tools wie Notion und GitHub automatisieren möchten","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Full-Stack que buscam automatizar o ciclo de vida do desenvolvimento de software usando ferramentas nativas de IA como Notion e GitHub","ru":"Идеально для агентов полного стека разработки, стремящихся автоматизировать жизненный цикл разработки программного обеспечения с помощью инструментов, родных для ИИ, таких как Notion и GitHub","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التطوير متعدد الطبقات الذين يسعون إلى توفير دورة حياة تطوير البرمجيات باستخدام أدوات موطن اليي مثل Notion و GitHub"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline the SDLC by automating tasks from intake to deployment, leveraging tools like `mcp__linear__get_issue` for intake and `mcp__github__search_code` for exploration, while utilizing protocols like Git for version control","zh":"赋予代理人通过自动执行从接收到部署的任务来简化SDLC的能力，利用像`mcp__linear__get_issue`的接收和`mcp__github__search_code`的探索等工具，同时利用Git等协议进行版本控制","ja":"エージェントに、`mcp__linear__get_issue`などの受け入れと`mcp__github__search_code`などの探索に使用されるツールを利用し、Gitなどのプロトコルを使用してバージョン管理を行うことで、SDLCを自動化するタスクを実行して簡素化する能力を付与","ko":"에이전트에게 `mcp__linear__get_issue` 등의 수신 및 `mcp__github__search_code` 등의 탐색에 사용되는 도구를 활용하고 Git 등의 프로토콜을 사용하여 버전 관리를 수행함으로써 SDLC를 자동화하는 작업을 수행하여 단순화하는 능력을 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a simplificar el SDLC automatizando tareas desde la ingesta hasta la implementación, aprovechando herramientas como `mcp__linear__get_issue` para la ingesta y `mcp__github__search_code` para la exploración, mientras se utilizan protocolos como Git para el control de versiones","fr":"Permet aux agents de rationaliser le SDLC en automatisant les tâches de la prise en charge à la mise en production, en exploitant des outils tels que `mcp__linear__get_issue` pour la prise en charge et `mcp__github__search_code` pour l''exploration, tout en utilisant des protocoles comme Git pour le contrôle de version","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, den SDLC zu rationalisieren, indem sie Aufgaben von der Aufnahme bis zur Bereitstellung automatisieren, indem sie Tools wie `mcp__linear__get_issue` für die Aufnahme und `mcp__github__search_code` für die Exploration nutzen und Protokolle wie Git für die Versionskontrolle verwenden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a simplificar o SDLC, automatizando tarefas desde a ingestão até a implantação, aproveitando ferramentas como `mcp__linear__get_issue` para ingestão e `mcp__github__search_code` para exploração, utilizando protocolos como Git para controle de versão","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью упростить SDLC, автоматизируя задачи от приема до развертывания, используя инструменты, такие как `mcp__linear__get_issue` для приема и `mcp__github__search_code` для изучения, используя протоколы, такие как Git для контроля версий","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من بسط SDLC عن طريق توفير المهام من الاستهلاك إلى التوزيع، باستخدام أدوات مثل `mcp__linear__get_issue` للاستهلاك و `mcp__github__search_code` للاستكشاف، مع استخدام بروتوكولات مثل Git للتحكم في الإصدار"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating issue tracking with `mcp__linear__get_issue` and `mcp__notion__notion-search`","Streamlining code exploration using `mcp__github__search_code` and `mcp__context7__query-docs`","Enhancing project planning with `mcp__linear__create_issue` and `mcp__notion__notion-create-pages`"],"zh":["使用`mcp__linear__get_issue`和`mcp__notion__notion-search`自动执行问题跟踪","使用`mcp__github__search_code`和`mcp__context7__query-docs`简化代码探索","使用`mcp__linear__create_issue`和`mcp__notion__notion-create-pages`增强项目规划"],"ja":["`mcp__linear__get_issue`と`mcp__notion__notion-search`を使用して問題追跡を自動化","`mcp__github__search_code`と`mcp__context7__query-docs`を使用してコード探索を簡素化","`mcp__linear__create_issue`と`mcp__notion__notion-create-pages`を使用してプロジェクト計画を強化"],"ko":["`mcp__linear__get_issue` 및 `mcp__notion__notion-search`를 사용하여 문제 추적을 자동화","`mcp__github__search_code` 및 `mcp__context7__query-docs`를 사용하여 코드 탐색을 단순화","`mcp__linear__create_issue` 및 `mcp__notion__notion-create-pages`를 사용하여 프로젝트 계획을 강화"],"es":["Automatización del seguimiento de problemas con `mcp__linear__get_issue` y `mcp__notion__notion-search`","Simplificación de la exploración de código utilizando `mcp__github__search_code` y `mcp__context7__query-docs`","Mejora de la planificación de proyectos con `mcp__linear__create_issue` y `mcp__notion__notion-create-pages`"],"fr":["Automatisation du suivi des problèmes avec `mcp__linear__get_issue` et `mcp__notion__notion-search`","Rationalisation de l''exploration de code à l''aide de `mcp__github__search_code` et `mcp__context7__query-docs`","Amélioration de la planification de projet avec `mcp__linear__create_issue` et `mcp__notion__notion-create-pages`"],"de":["Automatisierung der Problemmeldung mit `mcp__linear__get_issue` und `mcp__notion__notion-search`","Vereinfachung der Code-Exploration mit `mcp__github__search_code` und `mcp__context7__query-docs`","Verbesserung der Projektplanung mit `mcp__linear__create_issue` und `mcp__notion__notion-create-pages`"],"pt":["Automatizar o rastreamento de problemas com `mcp__linear__get_issue` e `mcp__notion__notion-search`","Simplificar a exploração de código usando `mcp__github__search_code` e `mcp__context7__query-docs`","Aprimorar o planejamento de projetos com `mcp__linear__create_issue` e `mcp__notion__notion-create-pages`"],"ru":["Автоматизировать отслеживание проблем с помощью `mcp__linear__get_issue` и `mcp__notion__notion-search`","Упростить изучение кода с помощью `mcp__github__search_code` и `mcp__context7__query-docs`","Улучшить планирование проектов с помощью `mcp__linear__create_issue` и `mcp__notion__notion-create-pages`"],"ar":["توفير تتبع المشكلات باستخدام `mcp__linear__get_issue` و `mcp__notion__notion-search`","تبسيط استكشاف الكود باستخدام `mcp__github__search_code` و `mcp__context7__query-docs`","تعزيز تخطيط المشروع باستخدام `mcp__linear__create_issue` و `mcp__notion__notion-create-pages`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires integration with Notion and GitHub APIs","Limited to SDLC phases outlined in the template"],"zh":["需要与Notion和GitHub APIs集成","仅限于模板中概述的SDLC阶段"],"ja":["NotionおよびGitHub APIとの統合が必要","テンプレートに概説されているSDLCの段階に限定"],"ko":["Notion 및 GitHub API와의 통합이 필요","템플릿에概説されている SDLC 단계에 한정"],"es":["Requiere integración con las API de Notion y GitHub","Limitado a las fases del SDLC definidas en la plantilla"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec les API Notion et GitHub","Limité aux phases du SDLC définies dans le modèle"],"de":["Erfordert die Integration mit den Notion- und GitHub-APIs","Begrenzt auf die im Template definierten SDLC-Phasen"],"pt":["Exige integração com as APIs do Notion e GitHub","Limitado às fases do SDLC delineadas no modelo"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с API Notion и GitHub","Ограничен фазами SDLC, изложенными в шаблоне"],"ar":["يتطلب التكامل مع واجهات برمجة التطبيقات Notion و GitHub","محدود بمواحل SDLC المحددة في القالب"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"80326c36902460a25ca2f96d39fd91f6ff39017a94294a79ab42e4ab58a066a2","qualityScore":36}');
